  "description": "I-RES Living are delighted to bring to market this superb unfurnished, 1-bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment in the sought after South Central, Rockbrook, Sandyford, Dublin 18. \nThis B1-rated 1 bed apartment comes with a bright, spacious entrance hall, modern kitchen with integrated appliances, granite worktops, open concept kitchen/living room together with spacious balcony, large master bedroom with built in wardrobe. Separate utility room for the washer/dryer and an attractive & modern main bathroom . \n\nLocation and amenities nearby South Central at Rockbrook offers residents a unique living experience with a vast number of amenities at it's doorstep. These include: \n\n-Dunnes Stores \n-Starbucks \n-Aldi \n-Bank of Ireland and \n-Beacon Hospital to name a few. \n\nDundrum Town Centre is just 3km away or 5 mins on the LUAS . \nThere are also a number of primary and secondary schools in the area as well as the Park Academy Creche at the Beacon South Quarter. \nGrande Central is also excellently served with superb transport links in the form of the LUAS Green Line, several bus routes to Dublin City Centre and the immediate area and also the M50 interchange giving direct access to Dublin Airport. \n\nFor relevant residents, a direct debit must be set up for monthly rental payments. Viewing is highly recommended, please complete the online enquiry form through www.daft.ie or www.iresliving.ie\n\nI-RES Living are the leading provider of quality professionally manged private residential rental accommodation in Ireland. We are committed to the highest levels of service to our residents in over 3,600 homes in sustainable communities across Dublin. More information at www.i-res.ie. \n\nAs an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: \n\n- Reliable professional service, when you need it \n- Fully trained staff to support you at every stage \n- Own inhouse maintenance team \n- 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services \n- Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal \n\nWe aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time. \n\n**Please note that the photos used in our marketing campaigns may vary from the actual apartment on offer. \n\nPersonal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy",
